          <p>
            If you are committed to Levels, the 5 lb tub is the obvious buy once you know you like a flavor. If you are trying it for the first time, start with the 2 lb size. The saving per gram on the large tub is real, but not large enough to justify being stuck with 71 servings of a flavor you dislike.
