                  The Amazon listings state 28 servings in the 2 lb Levels Grass Fed Whey and 71 servings in the 5 lb tub, each serving providing 24 g of protein. That implies a scoop of about 32 g. The casein is sold in 2 lb and 4 lb tubs; check the label for its serving count, as the listing details we checked did not state it.
                </p>
